cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "nav-trust-c2: human-on-the-loop navigation trust for simulated drones"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Telschow
    given-names: Daniel
repository-code: "https://github.com/Telschow/nav-trust-c2"
url: "https://telschow.github.io/nav-trust-c2/"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A simulation-only mission-control console that detects GNSS degradation in a small team of
  simulated drones, shows per-vehicle navigation trust with a measured position error, and
  recommends actions that wait for an operator's approval.
keywords:
  - GNSS
  - navigation
  - human-on-the-loop
  - PX4
  - simulation
